 "name_en": "Legal Control (1W8)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Legal Control (1W8)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc9bd153a43da4348982a7ffdeb863b6a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9bd153a43da4348982a7ffdeb863b6a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item supports global trade compliance with checks of relevant documents for adherence to the defined trade regulations.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can classify materials, define regulations and licenses, and activate export checks for documents and company codes. When relevant sales or purchasing documents are generated, and documents in violation of the trade policies are blocked, these blocked documents are resolved to remain compliant.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9bd153a43da4348982a7ffdeb863b6a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Manage global exports by managing:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Control groupings and classes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Product classification</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Numbering schemes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Legal regulations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Export licenses and order of use</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Blocked trade compliance documents</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9bd153a43da4348982a7ffdeb863b6a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support compliance of international trade</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Keep international trade processes frictionless</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Avoid financial loss</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Define customer-specific rules</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>进出口管制 (1W8)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc9bd153a43da4348982a7ffdeb863b6a\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9bd153a43da4348982a7ffdeb863b6a__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持全球贸易合规性，并检查相关凭证是否符合定义的贸易法规。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以对物料进行分类、定义法规和许可证，以及激活凭证和公司代码的出口检查。生成相关销售或采购凭证，并冻结违反贸易政策的凭证时，将解决这些冻结的凭证以保持合规性。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9bd153a43da4348982a7ffdeb863b6a__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过管理以下内容管理全球出口：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">控制分组和类</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">产品分类</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">编号方案</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">法律法规</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">出口许可证和使用顺序</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">冻结的贸易合规性凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc9bd153a43da4348982a7ffdeb863b6a__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">支持国际贸易合规性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">保持国际贸易流程顺畅</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">避免财务损失</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">定义客户特定规则</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
